{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"11c9c6d52dc7f323a55a32cb87da8c023373cd98578405a6b7b81642cd3d0a37","slug":"index","location":"/introduction.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"现代 CMake 简介","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Henry Schreiner","given":"Henry","family":"Schreiner"},"name":"Henry Schreiner","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"}],"github":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN","copyright":"2024","source_url":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/blob/main/introduction.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/edit/main/introduction.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"introduction.md","url":"/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/_public/introduction-36cdda669431564b28f2b1a78e71ac7f.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人们喜欢对构建系统抱有敌意。\n看看 CppCon17 上的演讲就知道了，开发者们把构建系统的现状当成头号笑料来调侃。\n这引出了一个问题：为什么？\n诚然，在构建项目时确实不乏各种各样的问题。\n但我认为，对于其中的不少问题，我们已经有了一个非常好的解决方案。\n那就是 CMake。但不是 CMake 2.8——那甚至是在 C++11 问世之前发布的！\n也不是网上流传的那些糟糕的 CMake 示例（甚至包括 KitWare 自己的教程列表里发布的一些例子）。\n我指的是现代 CMake（Modern CMake）：CMake 3.15+，甚至是 CMake 4.4+！\n它简洁、强大、优雅，因此你可以把大部分时间花在编写代码上，而不是往一个不可读、不可维护的 Make（或 CMake 2）文件里堆砌代码行。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"OP8TQOsrry"}],"key":"UlSmXRmhpQ"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"attention","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Attention","key":"PisPHBNB7z"}],"key":"mRqzjSlYGK"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本书是一份持续维护的文档。对于英文原版，你可以在 ","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"HrUanSYJYY"},{"type":"link","url":"https://gitlab.com/CLIUtils/modern-cmake","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"